OL,3,GNEWSAThird rejection for plans at Nude
OL,4,ADunes restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to convert an empty restaurant
OL,7,Finto holiday accommodation have been
OL,8,Frejected for a third time.
OL,10,FThe owners of Nude Dunes Food at La
OL,11,FPulente in St Brelade had proposed
OL,12,Fturning the site, which has been vacant
OL,13,Ffor nearly three years, into a
OL,14,Ftwo-bedroom self-catering flat and
OL,15,Fcafe.
OL,17,FDespite receiving support from Jersey
OL,18,FBusiness and the Jersey Hospitality
OL,19,FAssociation, the latest application has
OL,20,Fbeen refused permission by the
OL,21,Fgovernment's Planning Committee.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
