OL,3,GNEWSAThird rejection for plans at Nude
OL,4,ADunes restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrevious plans were rejected for the
OL,7,Fsite in 2024 and 2025 and arguments
OL,8,Fagainst the latest scheme included
OL,9,Ffailing to meet policy criteria and
OL,10,Fconcerns it would set a precedent for
OL,11,Fmore accommodation in the bay.
